__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.claude/

# Legacy Sula 0.18.x runtime state: derived/cache, never committed
**/.sula/cache/*
!**/.sula/cache/README.md
**/.sula/local/*
**/.sula/state/*
**/.sula/events/*
**/.sula/indexes/*
**/.sula/objects/*
**/.sula/sources/*
**/.sula/exports/*
**/.sula/projections/*
**/.sula/adapters/*
**/.sula/memory-digest.md

# Sula Vector caches (none currently, but reserve)
**/fragments/.cache/
# Sula transcripts stay on this machine
fragments/*--transcript-*
